    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "MMWard Estate Agents are delighted to present this unique property to the market, offering an excellent opportunity to acquire a secluded c. 1-acre site with an existing dwelling in the beautiful countryside of Valleymount, Co. Wicklow.\n\nApproached via a winding, tree-lined laneway, the property enjoys a wonderfully private and tranquil setting, surrounded by mature forestry and the natural beauty of the Wicklow countryside. \n\nThe existing accommodation comprises a one-bedroom cottage, while the site also benefits from a septic tank system and two additional ruins, offering significant potential for redevelopment, extension or the construction of a substantial family home, subject to the necessary planning permission.\n\nThe property presents a rare opportunity for those seeking to create a forever home in a peaceful rural setting, while still being within easy reach of surrounding towns and amenities.\n\n\nIdeally located just off the R756, Valleymount village is within easy reach, with Hollywood and Glendalough/Laragh approximately 20 minutes away by car. \n\nThe area is renowned for its stunning scenery, rolling countryside, forestry and proximity to the Wicklow Mountains. \n\nThe N81 is also easily accessible, providing convenient connections to Blessington, Dublin, Wexford and further afield.\n\nThis property offers tremendous potential for those looking for a private rural retreat or a site on which to create a bespoke home in one of the most scenic areas of Wicklow, subject to the necessary planning permission.\n\nPlease note that the site for sale is outlined in blue on the accompanying map.\nThe boundary shown is for identification purposes only and is an approximate indication of the site area."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Living room - 11'1\" (3.38m) x 16'9\" (5.11m)\nWooden floor, Fitted kitchen, Wood burning stove\n\nBedroom - 9'7\" (2.92m) x 10'5\" (3.18m)\nWooden floor\n\nEn-suite\nWooden floor, Bath with screen and electric shower, Window, WC, WHB\n\nNotice\nPlease note we have not tested any apparatus, fixtures, fittings, or services. Interested parties must undertake their own investigation into the working order of these items. All measurements are approximate and photographs provided for guidance only."
      },
